      "id": "claim_cdfc7a116c094bbc95ceefc020dae48c",
      "statement": "The library exposes a hierarchy rooted at `LibraryError`: search operational errors derive through `SearchError`, fetch request errors through `FetchError`, and `RenderError` directly from `LibraryError`; invalid entry-point arguments raise `ValueError` instead.",
