      "id": "claim_e003c64755b3489eb5e9a8d730ca870b",
      "statement": "Both `search()` and `fetch()` make an initial attempt plus `max_retries` additional attempts only for `primp.ConnectError` or `primp.TimeoutError`, sleeping exponential delays capped at 10 seconds; exhaustion is wrapped as the operation-specific request error with the original exception as its cause, while `primp.StatusError` is wrapped immediately.",
